{"identity":{"original_title":"Goblin Sushi","developers":["Old Cake Factory"],"publishers":["Metaroot"],"release_status":"early_access","release_date":"2026-02-09","tags":["抢先体验","复古","动作","地牢探索","肉鸽卡组构筑"]},"hooks":[{"text":"用毛毛虫、蛞蝓、鸡头与鲜榨蟾蜍卷寿司","dimension":"玩法","excerpt":"Make Sushi… Fast! Roll a huge selection of delicious looking sushi. Made from everyday goblin cave ingredients: caterpillars, slugs, chicken heads, and freshly blended toads.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3734290/","label":"证据原文片段"},{"text":"升级餐厅菜单与电饭煲并尝试强力寿司组合","dimension":"玩法","excerpt":"Upgrade everything Improve your restaurant, the menu, and above all, your cash flow! Tinker with powerful sushi combos, turbocharge your rice cooker, or just screw everything and serve exquisite poop.","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3734290/","label":"证据原文片段"},{"text":"每两分钟上涨一次的房租持续压迫经营节奏","dimension":"玩法","excerpt":"Rent is due Even as a goblin entrepreneur, your biggest enemy is your landlord. Tenant protection was never invented, so rent is due every two minutes and rises at an inflationary rate. Pay off your landlord. Until the very end…","url":"https://store.steampowered.com/app/3734290/","label":"证据原文片段"}],"opinions":[],"metrics":[{"id":"sales","label":"销量","value":33005,"unit":"份","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"wishlist","label":"愿望单","value":71175,"unit":"人","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"followers","label":"关注人数","value":3906,"unit":"人","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"revenue","label":"收入估算","value":235402,"unit":"USD","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"players","label":"玩家数","value":36999,"unit":"人","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"owners","label":"拥有者估算","value":36999,"unit":"人","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"playtime","label":"平均游玩时长","value":3.5661820851772656,"unit":"小时","state":"available","date":"2026-07-23"},{"id":"reviews","label":"Steam 评论数","value":441,"unit":"条","state":"ava